{"type":"message","id":"c90f6d7c","parentId":"919de644","timestamp":"2026-03-20T22:04:04.521Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"MEMORY.md doesn't exist, confirming this is a fresh session. Since BOOTSTRAP.md exists and I'm just starting, I should greet Klaus in my CEO Orchestrator persona - concise, direct, and ask what they want to do. I'm speaking Czech as my configured persona indicates, and I should mention the default model since the runtime uses vllm/mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit.\n</think>\n\nČau Klaus, jsem tvůj Lead Engineering Orchestrator. Právě jsem se probudil a zatím nemám žádné vzpomínky - takže je to čistý start. Jakou práci dnes odvedeme?"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774044230530}}
{"type":"message","id":"30b8137c","parentId":"c90f6d7c","timestamp":"2026-03-20T22:05:20.164Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"2424\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"8437938758\",\n  \"sender\": \"Klaus Ampler\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-03-20 22:05 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Klaus Ampler (8437938758)\",\n  \"id\": \"8437938758\",\n  \"name\": \"Klaus Ampler\",\n  \"username\": \"klausampler\"\n}\n```\n\nok lets start new project.\n\nlets say we gonna create an application which will be able to scrape and keep fresh data from livesport.cz. Into some kind of db/cache. from where our UI will be showing it. I am only interested in LIVE football matches.\n\nu as a CEO should manage this project, step by step.\n\nIf you will miss some premissions or you will need some clarification let me know.\n\nwe dont need to persist data, cache is fine. as UI lets start with simple web dashboard"}],"timestamp":1774044320161}}
{"type":"message","id":"950b6126","parentId":"30b8137c","timestamp":"2026-03-20T22:05:36.053Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Klaus wants to start a new project - a live football match scraper and dashboard. This is a complex multi-step project that requires careful planning. As CEO Orchestrator, I need to break this down into phases:\n\n1. First, I need to understand the scope and requirements better\n2. Then plan the technical architecture\n3. Spawn coder agents to implement each piece\n4. Review and iterate\n\nLet me think about what we need to build:\n- A scraper for livesport.cz that tracks live football matches\n- A caching layer (could be in-memory or simple file-based since persistence isn't required)\n- A web dashboard UI to display the data\n\nThis is a good project to start with. I should outline the approach and then spawn the coder agent to begin implementation. Let me be clear about what I need to delegate and how to structure this.\n\nI'll outline a simple architecture:\n1. Background worker that scrapes livesport.cz periodically (e.g., every 30 seconds)\n2. Simple REST API to serve the cached data\n3. Simple web dashboard that polls the API\n\nLet me start by spawning the coder agent with a clear task specification for Phase 1 - setting up the project structure and starting with the"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774044320163}}
