{"type":"message","id":"02e9be10","parentId":"c79b149f","timestamp":"2026-03-20T22:09:17.099Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Klaus wants to start a new project - a live football match scraper and dashboard. This is a complex multi-step project that requires careful planning. As CEO Orchestrator, I need to break this down into phases:\n\n1. First, I need to understand the scope and requirements better\n2. Then plan the technical architecture\n3. Spawn coder agents to implement each piece\n4. Review and iterate\n\nLet me think about what we need to build:\n- A scraper for livesport.cz that tracks live football matches\n- A caching layer (could be in-memory or simple file-based since persistence isn't required)\n- A simple web dashboard UI to display the data\n\nThis is a good project to start with. I should outline the approach and then spawn the coder agent to begin implementation. Let me be clear about what I need to delegate and how to structure this.\n\nI'll outline a simple architecture:\n1. Background worker that scrapes livesport.cz periodically (e.g., every 30 seconds)\n2. Simple REST API to serve the cached data\n3. Simple web dashboard that polls the API\n\nLet me start by spawning the coder agent with a clear task specification for Phase 1 - setting up the project structure and starting with"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774044539778}}
